                                        <a class="tafep-button ta:c tafep-button--secondary h:a w:100 p-x:xs p-y:xs ldsk(h:2xl) fz:m m-b:m vtab-btn-dg" href="https://www.tal.sg/tafep/resources/tools-and-templates/2022/introduction-to-fair-hiring">FEP e-Learning Course</a>
                                        
